56e3f5-9f2d-48f3-b55b-12f9f4d599ab, acknowledged the restart, returned under boot ID bac65080-68a4-4e38-962a-4b416b726695, and recovered the enabled service, listener, application data, and enforcing AppArmor state. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The fixed after-executor listening-sockets observation was empty despite direct successful listener and HTTP checks shortly beforehand; the capture does not explain this discrepancy, modestly lowering confidence.","Lifecycle snapshots do not inventory persistent application, unit, profile, or user files, so their final presence is supported by executor observations rather than independently enumerated by the lifecycle collector."]}
